  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 5, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Ya, makanannya enak. Boleh minta bonnya, Bu?', '{"English":"Yes, the food is delicious. May I have the bill, please?","German":"Ja, das Essen schmeckt. Könnte ich bitte die Rechnung haben?"}', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 6, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Permisi, saya ada reservasi atas nama Martin, Bu.', '{"English":"Excuse me, I have a reservation under the name Martin, ma’am.","German":"Entschuldigen Sie, ich habe eine Reservierung auf den Namen Martin."}', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 7, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Tidak ada lagi, Bu. Jadi, berapa semuanya?', '{"English":"Nothing else, ma’am. So, how much is everything?","German":"Sonst nichts, danke. Wie viel kostet dann alles zusammen?"}', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 8, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Halte bus ada di ujung jalan ini, Pak.', '{"English":"The bus stop is at the end of this street, sir.","German":"Die Bushaltestelle ist am Ende dieser Straße."}', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 9, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Setengah kilo jeruk, Bu. Dua mangga juga.', '{"English":"Half a kilo of oranges, ma’am. Two mangoes as well.","German":"Ein halbes Kilo Orangen, bitte. Dazu zwei Mangos."}', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 10, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Baik, Pak. Saya mulai kenal daerah ini.', '{"English":"Good, sir. I am starting to know this area.","German":"Gut, danke. Ich lerne diese Gegend langsam kennen."}', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-091-dari-jerman-tinggal-di-sini', 1, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya dari Jerman dan sekarang tinggal di sini. Kamu dari kota ini?', '{"English":"I am from Germany and live here now. Are you from this city?","German":"Ich komme aus Deutschland und wohne jetzt hier. Kommst du aus dieser Stadt?"}', '924c856ff501446539a490b2765a453f59694bb995fd4811dd9b40ac12e4d9a5'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-092-bekerja-di-kantor-pusat-kota', 2, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya bekerja di kantor di pusat kota. Kamu bekerja di mana?', '{"English":"I work in an office in the city center. Where do you work?","German":"Ich arbeite in einem Büro im Stadtzentrum. Wo arbeitest du?"}', 'fb7a1acf5e916b1a1bdcf3f57854882a31bd28f3091e827437859a168737d645'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-093-belajar-bahasa-karena-kamu', 3, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya belajar bahasa Indonesia karena saya suka bicara dengan kamu.', '{"English":"I study Indonesian because I like talking with you.","German":"Ich lerne Indonesisch, weil ich gern mit dir spreche."}', '1d9ca58cfac0486e8d4ef713ab3041a25dee4d2abc526585aa4e1a20ee27d107'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-094-sudah-dua-minggu-di-sini', 4, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Sudah dua minggu saya di sini. Kamu juga sering ke kafe ini?', '{"English":"I have been here for two weeks. Do you also come to this cafe often?","German":"Ich bin seit zwei Wochen hier. Kommst du auch oft in dieses Café?"}', '80814383976c32f24879bd89ccc2ac2715641edc90644fc876e0da028ef74b67'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-095-keluarga-telepon-setiap-minggu', 5, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Keluarga saya di Jerman. Saya telepon mereka setiap minggu. Kamu juga?', '{"English":"My family is in Germany. I call them every week. How about you?","German":"Meine Familie ist in Deutschland. Ich telefoniere jede Woche mit ihnen. Und du?"}', '6c44c299bd32493c26a8a0c17d43dc1b526fa954b3ad52cfcdc4c2fe19547059'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-096-suka-memasak-dan-berjalan', 6, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya suka memasak dan berjalan kaki di kampung. Kamu suka apa?', '{"English":"I like cooking and walking around the neighborhood. What do you like to do?","German":"Ich koche gern und gehe im Viertel spazieren. Was machst du gern?"}', 'b4e027b911e90c614cc77aa31539aecffee784c7cd3a0ad270d5b33607157bca'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 7, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya bekerja pagi hari dan belajar bahasa Indonesia malam hari. Kamu juga?', '{"English":"I work in the morning and study Indonesian at night. How about you?","German":"Ich arbeite morgens und lerne abends Indonesisch. Und du?"}', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 8, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya mengerti hampir semuanya, tetapi saya masih bicara pelan. Kamu mengerti?', '{"English":"I understand almost everything, but I still speak slowly. Do you understand me?","German":"Ich verstehe fast alles, aber ich spreche noch langsam. Verstehst du mich?"}', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 9, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Tahun depan saya datang lagi. Kamu senang mendengar kabar ini?', '{"English":"I am coming back next year. Are you happy to hear this news?","German":"Nächstes Jahr komme ich wieder. Freust du dich über diese Nachricht?"}', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 10, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Terima kasih untuk semua cerita. Saya sudah belajar banyak dari kamu. Sampai jumpa.', '{"English":"Thank you for all the stories. I have already learned a lot from you. See you.","German":"Danke für all die Geschichten. Ich habe schon viel von dir gelernt. Bis bald."}', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 1, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Yang ini saja, Bu, karena harganya lebih murah.', '{"English":"Just these, ma’am, because the price is lower.","German":"Nur diese hier, bitte, weil der Preis günstiger ist."}', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 2, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Hari ini saya pilih es teh, Pak, karena lebih dingin.', '{"English":"Today I choose iced tea, sir, because it is colder.","German":"Heute wähle ich Eistee, weil er kälter ist."}', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 3, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Bu, saya pilih baju biru karena ukurannya lebih pas.', '{"English":"Ma’am, I choose the blue shirt because the size fits better.","German":"Ich wähle das blaue Hemd, weil die Größe besser passt."}', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 4, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Bu, saya pilih soto karena lebih ringan dan tidak pedas.', '{"English":"Ma’am, I choose soto because it is lighter and not spicy.","German":"Ich wähle Soto, weil es leichter und nicht scharf ist."}', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 5, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Yang ini saja, Pak, karena rotinya lebih segar hari ini.', '{"English":"Just this one, sir, because the bread is fresher today.","German":"Nur dieses hier, bitte, weil das Brot heute frischer ist."}', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 6, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya pilih ojek, Pak, karena sekarang lebih cepat.', '{"English":"I choose the ojek, sir, because it is faster right now.","German":"Ich nehme das Motorradtaxi, weil es jetzt schneller ist."}', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 7, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya pilih kamar belakang, Bu, karena lebih tenang untuk tidur.', '{"English":"I choose the back room, ma’am, because it is quieter for sleeping.","German":"Ich wähle das hintere Zimmer, weil es zum Schlafen ruhiger ist."}', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 8, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya pilih sandal ini, Pak, karena rasanya lebih nyaman.', '{"English":"I choose these sandals, sir, because they feel more comfortable.","German":"Ich wähle diese Sandalen, weil sie sich bequemer anfühlen."}', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 9, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya pilih botol kecil, Bu, karena harganya lebih murah.', '{"English":"I choose the small bottle, ma’am, because its price is lower.","German":"Ich wähle die kleine Flasche, weil ihr Preis niedriger ist."}', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 10, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya suka kafe ini, Pak, karena dekat dan lebih tenang.', '{"English":"I like this cafe, sir, because it is close and quieter.","German":"Ich mag dieses Café, weil es nah und ruhiger ist."}', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 1, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya sudah bayar, Bu. Ini struknya.', '{"English":"I have already paid, ma’am. Here is the receipt.","German":"Ich habe schon bezahlt. Hier ist der Kassenbon."}', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 2, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya tiba kemarin malam, Bu, sekitar jam delapan.', '{"English":"I arrived last night at around eight, ma’am.","German":"Ich bin gestern Abend gegen acht Uhr angekommen."}', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 3, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya baru saja pesan nasi goreng, Bu, tanpa sambal.', '{"English":"I just ordered fried rice without sambal, ma’am.","German":"Ich habe gerade gebratenen Reis ohne Sambal bestellt."}', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 4, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Tadi pagi saya beli buah di pasar, Bu.', '{"English":"I bought fruit at the market this morning, ma’am.","German":"Heute Morgen habe ich auf dem Markt Obst gekauft."}', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 5, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Tadi saya belanja di pasar, Bu. Sekarang saya hanya lihat-lihat.', '{"English":"I shopped at the market earlier, ma’am. Now I am just looking around.","German":"Vorhin habe ich auf dem Markt eingekauft. Jetzt schaue ich mich nur um."}', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 6, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Tadi malam saya kurang tidur, Bu, tetapi hari ini lebih baik.', '{"English":"I did not get enough sleep last night, ma’am, but today I feel better.","German":"Letzte Nacht habe ich zu wenig geschlafen, aber heute geht es mir besser."}', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 7, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya sudah coba soto Betawi, Pak. Rasanya enak.', '{"English":"I have already tried Soto Betawi, sir. It tastes good.","German":"Ich habe Soto Betawi schon probiert. Es schmeckt gut."}', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 8, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya belum lihat kota tua, Bu, tetapi ingin ke sana.', '{"English":"I have not seen the old town yet, ma’am, but I want to go there.","German":"Ich habe die Altstadt noch nicht gesehen, möchte aber dorthin."}', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-029-kemarin-ke-museum', 9, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Pak, kemarin saya ke museum dari pagi sampai siang.', '{"English":"Sir, I was at the museum from morning until noon yesterday.","German":"Gestern war ich vom Morgen bis zum Mittag im Museum."}', '4819db6c18040b75f9b240b8c7337e4c5731b90910628591c933ee8bb259b3f6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-030-minggu-ini-sudah-banyak', 10, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Minggu ini saya sudah banyak jalan-jalan dan belajar, Bu.', '{"English":"This week I have already done a lot of sightseeing and studying, ma’am.","German":"Diese Woche habe ich schon viel unternommen und gelernt."}', '879c0b073ec38b58718743313ec7942daf6da841eab5d020b60cb14802cb5721'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-031-bagaimana-kalau-nanti', 1, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Bagaimana kalau kita minum kopi nanti jam tujuh? Kamu bisa?', '{"English":"How about coffee later at seven? Can you make it?","German":"Wie wäre es, wenn wir später um sieben Kaffee trinken? Kannst du da?"}', '354fa2d6264e723c2d6ef7de012d8517fbb3800ca438ee02ddac5b0bcb393f01'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-032-besok-mau-ke-museum', 2, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Besok saya mau ke museum. Kamu mau ikut?', '{"English":"I am going to the museum tomorrow. Do you want to come along?","German":"Morgen möchte ich ins Museum. Möchtest du mitkommen?"}', '7584e70515e11ee616b714361f0a993d8a2f9301b2c4369d919fc1e2f0b3b468'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-033-mau-menonton-hari-jumat', 3, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Kamu mau menonton film hari Jumat? Bagaimana kalau malam?', '{"English":"Do you want to watch a film on Friday? How about the evening?","German":"Möchtest du am Freitag einen Film sehen? Wie wäre es am Abend?"}', 'a9f7f66e89350b50417287e56d959d466503ad3361581feb7b6734f217b09c3e'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-034-bertemu-di-pintu-mal', 4, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Nanti kita bertemu jam tujuh di pintu masuk mal. Kamu setuju?', '{"English":"We will meet later at seven at the mall entrance. Do you agree?","German":"Später treffen wir uns um sieben am Eingang des Einkaufszentrums. Bist du einverstanden?"}', '1658cd0709407c1a3c11b3d1364d5e397eccfc297a9ed6eb1a282f01cda509e7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-035-ganti-rencana-ke-sabtu', 5, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Bisa kita ganti jadwal besok ke hari Sabtu? Kamu setuju?', '{"English":"Can we move tomorrow’s appointment to Saturday? Do you agree?","German":"Können wir den Termin von morgen auf Samstag verschieben? Bist du einverstanden?"}', 'e33d14e3798921ee74b039bd5ff3c59f67dc19bd5115557a5619637d89ad7653'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 6, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Maaf, saya tidak bisa datang nanti malam karena harus bekerja. Kamu mengerti?', '{"English":"Sorry, I cannot come tonight because I have to work. Do you understand?","German":"Tut mir leid, ich kann heute Abend nicht kommen, weil ich arbeiten muss. Verstehst du?"}', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 7, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Ayo makan malam besok. Kamu pilih tempatnya, saya yang bayar.', '{"English":"Let’s have dinner tomorrow. You choose the place, and I will pay.","German":"Lass uns morgen Abend essen gehen. Du wählst den Ort aus, ich bezahle."}', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 8, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Maaf, saya akan terlambat sepuluh menit. Kamu tunggu di kafe, ya?', '{"English":"Sorry, I will be ten minutes late. Wait at the cafe, okay?","German":"Tut mir leid, ich werde zehn Minuten zu spät sein. Warte bitte im Café, ja?"}', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 9, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Jadi, besok kita bertemu jam tujuh di sini, ya? Kamu ingat?', '{"English":"So, we meet here tomorrow at seven, okay? Do you remember?","German":"Also, morgen treffen wir uns um sieben hier, ja? Erinnerst du dich?"}', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 10, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Minggu depan saya mau pergi ke Bogor. Kamu mau ikut?', '{"English":"I am going to Bogor next week. Do you want to come along?","German":"Nächste Woche möchte ich nach Bogor fahren. Möchtest du mitkommen?"}', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 1, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Tadi saya pesan teh, bukan kopi, Bu.', '{"English":"I ordered tea earlier, not coffee, ma’am.","German":"Vorhin habe ich Tee bestellt, nicht Kaffee."}', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 2, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Maaf, baju ini terlalu kecil. Boleh ganti ukuran, Bu?', '{"English":"Excuse me, this shirt is too small. Could I exchange it for another size, ma’am?","German":"Entschuldigung, dieses Hemd ist zu klein. Kann ich es gegen eine andere Größe umtauschen?"}', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 3, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Maaf, boleh ganti minumannya? Saya minta air putih saja, Bu.', '{"English":"Excuse me, could I have a different drink instead? I’d like plain water, ma’am.","German":"Entschuldigung, könnte ich stattdessen ein anderes Getränk bekommen? Ich hätte gern stilles Wasser."}', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 4, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Maaf, bukan yang ini, Bu. Saya minta yang itu saja.', '{"English":"Excuse me, not these, ma’am. I’d like those instead.","German":"Entschuldigung, nicht diese hier. Ich hätte gern die dort."}', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 5, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Maaf, kamar ini terlalu berisik. Boleh ganti kamar, Bu?', '{"English":"Excuse me, this room is too noisy. May I change rooms, ma’am?","German":"Entschuldigung, dieses Zimmer ist zu laut. Kann ich das Zimmer wechseln?"}', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 6, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Tidak, terima kasih, Bu. Cukup yang ini saja.', '{"English":"No, thank you, ma’am. This one alone is enough.","German":"Nein, danke. Nur dieses hier reicht mir."}', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 7, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Maaf, Bu, sepertinya salah hitung. Bisa periksa lagi?', '{"English":"Excuse me, ma’am, there seems to be a calculation error. Can you check again?","German":"Entschuldigung, anscheinend stimmt die Rechnung nicht. Können Sie noch einmal nachsehen?"}', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 8, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Maaf, boleh minta kemasan yang lebih kecil, Bu?', '{"English":"Excuse me, may I have a smaller pack, ma’am?","German":"Entschuldigung, könnte ich bitte eine kleinere Packung bekommen?"}', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 9, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Maaf, Pak, tujuan saya stasiun, bukan mal.', '{"English":"Excuse me, sir, my destination is the station, not the mall.","German":"Entschuldigung, mein Ziel ist der Bahnhof, nicht das Einkaufszentrum."}', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 10, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Maaf, hari ini saya tidak bisa, Pak. Lain kali, ya.', '{"English":"Sorry, I cannot today, sir. Another time, okay?","German":"Entschuldigung, heute kann ich leider nicht. Ein anderes Mal, ja?"}', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 1, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya mau laundry tiga baju ini, Bu. Kapan bisa selesai?', '{"English":"I would like to have these three items washed, ma’am. When can they be done?","German":"Ich möchte diese drei Kleidungsstücke waschen lassen. Wann sind sie fertig?"}', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-052-perbaiki-layar-telepon', 2, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Bisa perbaiki layar telepon ini, Pak? Layarnya rusak.', '{"English":"Can you repair this phone screen, sir? The screen is broken.","German":"Können Sie den Bildschirm dieses Handys reparieren? Der Bildschirm ist kaputt."}', '0dd63b2946af4080a292e0d44767f30a17ddd9416c55060d7961ed9a27a840cf'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-053-isi-pulsa-lima-puluh-ribu', 3, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Tolong isi pulsa lima puluh ribu, Bu. Nomor ini.', '{"English":"Please top up fifty thousand rupiah of phone credit, ma’am. This number.","German":"Bitte laden Sie fünfzigtausend Rupiah Guthaben auf. Diese Nummer hier."}', 'b1326da56ca00e893db7baa2bc3de87108dae99af531ce1355a01be2d130d21e'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-054-buat-janji-hari-kamis', 4, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya perlu buat janji hari Kamis, Bu. Jam tujuh bisa?', '{"English":"I need to make an appointment for Thursday, ma’am. Is seven possible?","German":"Ich muss einen Termin für Donnerstag vereinbaren. Ist sieben Uhr möglich?"}', '88cf1a9f43a29303d5fe949efb9d8231234f1c06f942ca1f00a7406087a4a00d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-055-minta-duplikat-kunci', 5, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya minta duplikat kunci ini, Pak. Berapa harganya?', '{"English":"I would like a copy of this key, sir. How much is it?","German":"Ich möchte eine Kopie dieses Schlüssels. Wie viel kostet sie?"}', 'ed0c6cdf96b80b3e773ff7fbc6b917e85fb581d34bbac70233a750519ad5f756'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-056-ambil-paket-atas-nama', 6, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya ambil paket atas nama Martin, Bu. Ini kartunya.', '{"English":"I am picking up a package under the name Martin, ma’am. Here is the card.","German":"Ich hole ein Paket auf den Namen Martin ab. Hier ist die Karte."}', '3bcb87e1d4a7a02916882ba9ed6957b028286bdbd3c35583616815a8eed876ab'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-057-sewa-sepeda-dua-hari', 7, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya sewa sepeda ini untuk dua hari, Pak.', '{"English":"I am renting this bicycle for two days, sir.","German":"Ich miete dieses Fahrrad für zwei Tage."}', '9bc77b7ee776dd95d7cbf7fc9593dcf389e8f6aa26b8a52a8f770d9b2ad3f8d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 8, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Permisi, toko ini buka sampai jam berapa, Bu?', '{"English":"Excuse me, what time is this shop open until, ma’am?","German":"Entschuldigung, bis wie viel Uhr ist dieses Geschäft geöffnet?"}', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 9, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya ambil telepon saya, Pak. Teleponnya siap?', '{"English":"I am picking up my phone, sir. Is it ready?","German":"Ich hole mein Handy ab. Ist es bereit?"}', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 10, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Terima kasih, Bu. Semua urusan selesai. Sampai hari Kamis.', '{"English":"Thank you, ma’am. All the errands are complete. See you on Thursday.","German":"Vielen Dank. Alle Besorgungen sind erledigt. Bis Donnerstag."}', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 1, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Apa rekomendasi Ibu? Saya ingin makanan yang enak dan ringan.', '{"English":"What do you recommend, ma’am? I would like food that is tasty and light.","German":"Was empfehlen Sie? Ich möchte ein Gericht, das lecker und leicht ist."}', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 2, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Kalau begitu, saya pilih itu, Bu. Kelihatannya segar dan ringan.', '{"English":"In that case, I choose that, ma’am. It looks fresh and light.","German":"Dann wähle ich das. Es sieht frisch und leicht aus."}', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-063-daerah-paling-aman', 3, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Pak, daerah mana yang paling aman dan paling tenang untuk jalan kaki?', '{"English":"Sir, which area is the safest and quietest for walking?","German":"Welche Gegend ist am sichersten und am ruhigsten zum Spazierengehen?"}', '716160e7366bff8b340de7ccae626a97ee840c4bc92823d4e8ec5de71227276e'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-064-taman-tenang-dan-sejuk', 4, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Taman di sebelah sungai itu tenang dan sejuk, Bu.', '{"English":"The park beside the river is quiet and pleasantly cool, ma’am.","German":"Der Park neben dem Fluss ist ruhig und angenehm kühl."}', '34d0f403f01ac77604de778681cba23cdb61462ecd5fb0467f8dc25e1b47589e'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-065-kafe-paling-dekat', 5, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Pak, kafe mana yang paling dekat dan makanannya paling enak?', '{"English":"Sir, which cafe is the closest and has the best food?","German":"Welches Café ist am nächsten und hat das beste Essen?"}', 'f1fd369f6354538bee85f4e129d047f5dbe4bc54de3ad1145fa465bcb1d84570'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-066-ide-oleh-oleh-ringan', 6, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Bu, ada ide oleh-oleh yang kecil dan ringan untuk teman?', '{"English":"Ma’am, do you have an idea for a small, light souvenir for a friend?","German":"Haben Sie eine Idee für ein kleines, leichtes Mitbringsel für einen Freund?"}', 'e22fc539627caa4b26ae906f511a3e3a289d2e610006c3b57e5af9e1ea1debbc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-067-restoran-khas-dekat-hotel', 7, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Pak, restoran mana di dekat hotel yang makanannya khas dan murah?', '{"English":"Sir, which restaurant near the hotel has local, affordable food?","German":"Welches Restaurant in Hotelnähe hat typisches, günstiges Essen?"}', 'f17b1e3295612bdff98343ed22c984aab6653a91db5f6d5c92a4986d0047e599'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-068-pasar-malam-ramai-seru', 8, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya sarankan pasar malam itu, Bu. Tempatnya ramai dan seru.', '{"English":"I recommend that night market, ma’am. The place is lively and fun.","German":"Ich empfehle Ihnen den Nachtmarkt. Dort ist es lebhaft und unterhaltsam."}', '0f3df9dbc53600150274c9dc43fa3a02cc7be90a62a5fb85ba569bf3db0a469a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 9, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Bu, makanan penutup mana yang manis dan cocok dengan kopi?', '{"English":"Ma’am, which dessert is sweet and goes well with coffee?","German":"Welcher Nachtisch ist süß und passt gut zum Kaffee?"}', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 10, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Terima kasih, Bu. Kue ini sangat lembut dan enak sekali.', '{"English":"Thank you, ma’am. This cake is very soft and truly delicious.","German":"Vielen Dank. Dieser Kuchen ist sehr weich und wirklich köstlich."}', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 1, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Wah, selamat! Kamu pasti senang sekali.', '{"English":"Wow, congratulations! You must be very happy.","German":"Wow, Glückwunsch! Du bist bestimmt sehr froh."}', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 2, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Iya, panas sekali. Kamu mau minum es teh?', '{"English":"Yes, it is very hot. Do you want to drink iced tea?","German":"Ja, es ist sehr heiß. Möchtest du Eistee trinken?"}', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 3, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Iya, tadi malam saya kurang tidur. Kamu juga mengantuk?', '{"English":"Yes, I did not get enough sleep last night. Are you sleepy too?","German":"Ja, letzte Nacht habe ich zu wenig geschlafen. Bist du auch schläfrig?"}', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 4, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Iya, minggu ini saya sibuk sekali. Kamu bagaimana?', '{"English":"Yes, I am very busy this week. How about you?","German":"Ja, diese Woche bin ich sehr beschäftigt. Und wie ist es bei dir?"}', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 5, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Aduh, hujan lagi. Kamu mau menunggu di sini?', '{"English":"Oh no, it is raining again. Do you want to wait here?","German":"Ach, es regnet schon wieder. Möchtest du hier warten?"}', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 6, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Aduh, sayang sekali. Kamu mau saya temani ke dokter hewan?', '{"English":"Oh, what a shame. Do you want me to accompany you to the vet?","German":"Ach, wie schade. Soll ich dich zum Tierarzt begleiten?"}', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 7, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Cukup baik. Kamu sendiri bagaimana minggu ini?', '{"English":"Pretty good. How about you this week?","German":"Ganz gut. Und wie geht es dir diese Woche?"}', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 8, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Wah, bagus sekali! Kamu memang hebat.', '{"English":"Wow, that is great! You really are amazing.","German":"Wow, das ist großartig! Du bist wirklich klasse."}', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 9, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Iya, dingin sekali. Kamu mau minum kopi hangat?', '{"English":"Yes, it is very cold. Do you want to drink warm coffee?","German":"Ja, es ist sehr kalt. Möchtest du warmen Kaffee trinken?"}', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 10, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Iya, hari ini menyenangkan. Kamu juga senang?', '{"English":"Yes, today is lovely. Are you happy too?","German":"Ja, heute ist ein schöner Tag. Bist du auch froh?"}', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 1, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Air panasnya tidak keluar, Pak. Saya sudah telepon resepsionis. Bisa tolong periksa?', '{"English":"The hot water is not coming out, sir. I have already called reception. Can you please check?","German":"Es kommt kein heißes Wasser. Ich habe schon an der Rezeption angerufen. Können Sie bitte nachsehen?"}', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 2, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya sudah pesan soto, Bu, tetapi makanannya belum datang. Bisa tolong periksa?', '{"English":"I have already ordered soto, ma’am, but the food has not arrived yet. Can you please check?","German":"Ich habe schon Soto bestellt, aber das Essen ist noch nicht gekommen. Können Sie bitte nachsehen?"}', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 3, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya tidak bisa pakai Wi-Fi, Bu. Saya sudah coba dua kali. Tolong periksa.', '{"English":"I cannot use the Wi-Fi, ma’am. I have already tried twice. Please check.","German":"Ich kann das WLAN nicht benutzen. Ich habe es schon zweimal versucht. Bitte prüfen Sie das."}', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 4, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Kunci saya hilang, Bu. Saya sudah cari, tetapi tidak bisa masuk kamar. Tolong bantu.', '{"English":"My key is missing, ma’am. I have already looked, but I cannot enter the room. Please help.","German":"Mein Schlüssel ist weg. Ich habe schon gesucht, kann aber nicht ins Zimmer. Bitte helfen Sie mir."}', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 5, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Taksi saya belum datang, Pak. Saya sudah menunggu lama. Tolong panggil yang lain.', '{"English":"My taxi has not arrived yet, sir. I have already waited a long time. Please call another one.","German":"Mein Taxi ist noch nicht gekommen. Ich habe schon lange gewartet. Bitte rufen Sie ein anderes."}', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 6, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Kembalian saya kurang dua ribu, Bu. Saya sudah bayar penuh. Tolong periksa.', '{"English":"My change is short by two thousand rupiah, ma’am. I have already paid in full. Please check.","German":"Bei meinem Rückgeld fehlen zweitausend Rupiah. Ich habe vollständig bezahlt. Bitte prüfen Sie es."}', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 7, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Saya beli kipas ini tadi, Pak, tetapi sekarang rusak. Tolong ganti.', '{"English":"I bought this fan earlier, sir, but now it is broken. Please replace it.","German":"Ich habe diesen Ventilator vorhin gekauft, aber jetzt ist er kaputt. Bitte tauschen Sie ihn um."}', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 8, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Supnya sudah datang, Bu, tetapi sekarang dingin. Bisa tolong hangatkan?', '{"English":"The soup has arrived, ma’am, but now it is cold. Can you please warm it up?","German":"Die Suppe ist schon da, aber jetzt ist sie kalt. Können Sie sie bitte aufwärmen?"}', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 9, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Tadi malam saya kurang tidur. Kamarnya berisik, Bu. Tolong pindahkan saya ke kamar lain.', '{"English":"I did not get enough sleep last night. The room is noisy, ma’am. Please move me to another room.","German":"Letzte Nacht habe ich zu wenig geschlafen. Das Zimmer ist laut. Bitte geben Sie mir ein anderes Zimmer."}', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 10, 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'id-ID', 'German', 'Tadi air panasnya tidak keluar, Pak. Sekarang semuanya berfungsi. Terima kasih banyak atas bantuannya.', '{"English":"Earlier no hot water was coming out, sir. Now everything works. Thank you very much for your help.","German":"Vorhin kam kein heißes Wasser. Jetzt funktioniert alles. Vielen Dank für Ihre Hilfe."}', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('italian-a1-practical-1', 'italian-a1-practical-001-primo-contatto', 1, 'bright', 'Italian', 'it-IT', 'German', 'Salve, parla italiano?', '{"English":"Hello, do you speak Italian?","German":"Hallo, sprechen Sie Italienisch?"}', '229c24d3da9506b427bf48bafde371c92d693d72c73cbe3bc3160144bdcc4fa6'),
  ('italian-a1-practical-1', 'italian-a1-practical-002-chiedere-ripetere', 2, 'bright', 'Italian', 'it-IT', 'German', 'Scusi, può ripetere?', '{"English":"Excuse me, could you repeat that?","German":"Entschuldigung, können Sie das wiederholen?"}', 'b86da2b71b466fc6ab4f7f52950120a65aabaa6b6931a9671626b5f8d48251e9'),
  ('italian-a1-practical-1', 'italian-a1-practical-003-dov-e', 3, 'bright', 'Italian', 'it-IT', 'German', 'Scusi, dov''è la stazione?', '{"English":"Excuse me, where is the station?","German":"Entschuldigung, wo ist der Bahnhof?"}', 'd6587b2c21c64fa277fa86ec737973eb2b8dae5da7457532e7678b9eda1ae43b'),
