  ('korean-a2-practical-10', 'korean-a2-practical-10-096-yorihago-sanchaegeul-haeyo', 6, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '저는 요리하고 산책을 자주 해요.', '{"English":"I often cook and go for walks.","German":"Ich koche oft und gehe spazieren."}', '671d5cc0c82413c304f4a8a7c45fc1ac4b40fe8062d25e5961e7afa102484d1b'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-10', 'korean-a2-practical-10-097-achim-e-ilhago-gongbuhaeyo', 7, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '저는 아침에 일하고 저녁에 한국어를 공부해요.', '{"English":"I work in the morning and study Korean in the evening.","German":"Ich arbeite morgens und lerne abends Koreanisch."}', 'fe1b73c6a072ed06b832ac33e1b5e1f2bd2503c162631b3617c7bd47a0340f28'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-10', 'korean-a2-practical-10-098-cheoncheonhi-malhaeyo', 8, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '이제 거의 다 알아들어요. 그런데 아직 천천히 말해요.', '{"English":"Now I understand almost everything. But I still speak slowly.","German":"Jetzt verstehe ich fast alles. Aber ich spreche noch langsam."}', '22bfe63d44eb8912db71ea6e088e448178112e92ba2ee9046d42832acf3251be'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-10', 'korean-a2-practical-10-099-naenyeone-tto-ol-geoyeyo', 9, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '저는 내년에 또 올 거예요.', '{"English":"I will come back next year.","German":"Ich werde nächstes Jahr wiederkommen."}', '0f283e01613e5fd3c3855f2988ff7f2a1a25504511a259d4fff868e532855717'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-10', 'korean-a2-practical-10-100-jeongmal-gamsahamnida-tto-mannayo', 10, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '그동안 정말 감사합니다. 또 만나요!', '{"English":"Thank you so much for everything. See you again!","German":"Vielen Dank für alles. Wir sehen uns wieder!"}', '027675aeb2915e49dce1be08141de6c1def86d7de86a77cbd396b2431d0bff89'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-2', 'korean-a2-practical-2-011-ige-deo-ssaseo', 1, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '이게 더 싸서 이걸로 주세요.', '{"English":"This one is cheaper, so please give me this one.","German":"Dieses ist günstiger, also bitte dieses hier."}', 'c22c730fc1bd324b30e5f9cbf2e2f40db0ba826699bfc6fa8e89440e4cf35659'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-2', 'korean-a2-practical-2-012-deowoseo-iceuro', 2, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '오늘은 너무 더워서 아이스로 할게요.', '{"English":"It is so hot today, so I will have it iced.","German":"Heute ist es so heiß, deshalb nehme ich es mit Eis."}', '3f726ef6dce849882ff145e36d533208a4e1e46284ebcf03d4ef3fc512161c3b'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-2', 'korean-a2-practical-2-013-paransaegi-deo-yeppeo', 3, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '파란색이 더 예뻐서 이걸로 할게요.', '{"English":"The blue one is prettier, so I will take this one.","German":"Blau ist hübscher, deshalb nehme ich dieses hier."}', 'dd24da9496c626689732340a30a0e014c614d6cf43e769fd4e104f4b08d55d76'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-2', 'korean-a2-practical-2-014-gugi-deo-gabyeowo', 4, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '국이 더 가벼워서 이걸로 할게요.', '{"English":"The soup is lighter, so I will take this dish.","German":"Die Suppe ist leichter, deshalb nehme ich dieses Gericht."}', '86cd9633063b15432758a9d69cb0c2a5f0e173cb408c24a0e345b9a9eabfaf90'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-2', 'korean-a2-practical-2-015-ttatteuthaeseo-ppang', 5, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '이 빵이 더 따뜻해서 이걸로 할게요.', '{"English":"This bread is warmer, so I will take this one.","German":"Dieses Brot ist wärmer, deshalb nehme ich dieses hier."}', '1e9453d2db8a78710886333b4f8f914dd7f03093e2cc09b00c082e2ae1740d20'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-2', 'korean-a2-practical-2-016-jihacheori-deo-ppalla', 6, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '지하철이 더 빨라서 지하철로 가요.', '{"English":"The subway is faster, so we go by subway.","German":"Die U-Bahn ist schneller, deshalb fahren wir mit der U-Bahn."}', '503842695efc5a94b0a27cb0493abe5bb45725038b2595fa321c3477a17401d5'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-2', 'korean-a2-practical-2-017-joyonghan-bang', 7, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '조용한 방이 더 편해서 이 방으로 할게요.', '{"English":"The quiet room is more comfortable, so I will take this room.","German":"Das ruhige Zimmer ist bequemer, deshalb nehme ich dieses Zimmer."}', 'dc412b862738d7868801e9966941b4d7efde46f18a9d78a5d32a5faf917d4836'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-2', 'korean-a2-practical-2-018-sinbari-deo-pyeonhae', 8, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '이 신발이 더 편해서 이걸로 할게요.', '{"English":"This shoe is more comfortable, so I will take this one.","German":"Dieser Schuh ist bequemer, deshalb nehme ich diesen."}', '9523bfefed31fdee8f2cd03fe2d2dd7754f93af453166932de453483212dfc70'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-2', 'korean-a2-practical-2-019-jageun-mulbyeong', 9, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '작은 물병이 더 싸서 이걸로 할게요.', '{"English":"The small water bottle is cheaper, so I will take this one.","German":"Die kleine Wasserflasche ist günstiger, deshalb nehme ich diese."}', 'd3d522564d489247fdd8c7b1ae0e340af9c927e6fc12ade066f23a50c0501c74'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-2', 'korean-a2-practical-2-020-gakkapgo-joyonghan-cafe', 10, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '가깝고 조용해서 이 카페를 좋아해요.', '{"English":"Because it is close and quiet, I like this cafe.","German":"Weil es nah und ruhig ist, mag ich dieses Café."}', 'e5d74d1a39e36500b80f197aa997c8916c43c6ccdeab135131e6b61d36d3dc69'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-3', 'korean-a2-practical-3-021-beolsseo-gyesanhaesseoyo', 1, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '벌써 계산했어요. 영수증도 한 장 주세요.', '{"English":"I already paid. Please give me a receipt too.","German":"Ich habe schon bezahlt. Bitte auch einen Beleg."}', 'e813a3def68c5f1872b3a5b71e3ce1f1260a24339970b04182a8f5151ee116b3'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-3', 'korean-a2-practical-3-022-eojenyeok-dochakaesseoyo', 2, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '어제 저녁에 호텔에 늦게 도착했어요.', '{"English":"I arrived at the hotel late yesterday evening.","German":"Ich bin gestern Abend spät im Hotel angekommen."}', 'b48b6ef40f8a8e157d2c4c5e97817cd66dca31df17c0d548c59539869db3e04c'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-3', 'korean-a2-practical-3-023-beolsseo-jumunhaesseoyo', 3, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '벌써 메뉴를 주문했어요. 물도 주세요.', '{"English":"I already ordered the food. Please give me water too.","German":"Ich habe das Essen schon bestellt. Bitte auch Wasser."}', 'c8b059bb123198a837a5b1a92510d848b15fbe58f225c4cf749527d4c868a71c'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-3', 'korean-a2-practical-3-024-oneul-achime-gwail-sasseoyo', 4, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '오늘 아침에 시장에서 과일을 샀어요.', '{"English":"I bought fruit at the market this morning.","German":"Ich habe heute Morgen auf dem Markt Obst gekauft."}', '16269963eae13737974349230ccefc7f23c47b3f50e0e84d3e0bf628b1aa5ed1'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-3', 'korean-a2-practical-3-025-sijangeseo-jangeul-bwasseoyo', 5, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '오늘 아침에 시장에서 장을 봤어요.', '{"English":"I did my shopping at the market this morning.","German":"Ich habe heute Morgen auf dem Markt eingekauft."}', 'f49cb0a43f0a3467b180d30038508dfd4655aba3a3b89f366e72d7c785eaba8d'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-3', 'korean-a2-practical-3-026-eje-jal-mot-jasseoyo', 6, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '어제 잘 못 잤어요. 오늘은 괜찮아요.', '{"English":"I did not sleep well yesterday. I am fine today.","German":"Ich habe gestern nicht gut geschlafen. Heute geht es mir gut."}', 'acc50f6a6befa669da1fa82844ce46d8c851671ca27f0e398a8e4dd8590ca487'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-3', 'korean-a2-practical-3-027-bibimbapeun-beolsseo-meogeosseoyo', 7, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '비빔밥은 벌써 먹었어요. 정말 맛있어요.', '{"English":"I have already eaten bibimbap. It is really delicious.","German":"Bibimbap habe ich schon gegessen. Es ist wirklich lecker."}', '0f7b510b37020aa6f2ce7acbb7d0f7c5b7d7cde59e6dfe8022ec71e89555f277'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-3', 'korean-a2-practical-3-028-gyeongbokgung-ajik-mot-bwasseoyo', 8, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '경복궁은 아직 못 봤어요. 내일 가요.', '{"English":"I have not seen Gyeongbokgung yet. I am going tomorrow.","German":"Den Gyeongbokgung habe ich noch nicht gesehen. Morgen gehe ich hin."}', '8b24be7ae89e6d25e8fe7c57eb51d7e3875e0afe14ecb21514445dfbf08b5296'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-3', 'korean-a2-practical-3-029-eje-bangmulgwane-gasseoyo', 9, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '어제 박물관에 갔어요. 사진이 많아요.', '{"English":"I went to the museum yesterday. There are many photos.","German":"Ich war gestern im Museum. Es gibt viele Fotos."}', '38c30d4d53e5e522d465089ed8138b49bbd2d7dc32c89670d559e6b067bedf65'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-3', 'korean-a2-practical-3-030-ibeon-jue-mani-haesseoyo', 10, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '이번 주에 정말 많이 했어요.', '{"English":"I did a lot this week.","German":"Ich habe diese Woche wirklich viel gemacht."}', '7409c5851932e76a75f88e9e9e156f96ad863e803d6ca7cf3b6d5fac42358d10'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-031-ohu-e-mannalkkayo', 1, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '좋아요. 내일 오후에 커피 마실까요?', '{"English":"Sounds good. Shall we have coffee tomorrow afternoon?","German":"Gern. Trinken wir morgen Nachmittag Kaffee?"}', '065a33e35fe707713968d618efc66ff88be869ec2c82f48af1ee5660136db1dc'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-032-misulgwan-gal-geoyeyo', 2, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '저는 내일 미술관에 갈 거예요.', '{"English":"I will go to the art museum tomorrow.","German":"Ich werde morgen ins Kunstmuseum gehen."}', 'e42bcb8e87b53cdb534eabb900ac78790011526e93a0d70b4f17f6c7e8132ce5'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-033-geumyoil-yeonghwa-bolkkayo', 3, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '금요일에 같이 영화 한 편 볼까요?', '{"English":"Shall we watch a movie together on Friday?","German":"Sollen wir am Freitag zusammen einen Film sehen?"}', '3df4f536b1ad64612466be8fdcb77a2cb97c326ba67c8bb0c9807de6ab9f0792'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-034-yeodeol-si-yeok-ape', 4, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '여덟 시에 역 앞에서 만나요.', '{"English":"We will meet at eight in front of the station.","German":"Wir treffen uns um acht vor dem Bahnhof."}', 'a45dafd42ae133baaea7166cd40c08ae66a6eca4f2c4871546f37539bfa2f919'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-035-toyoillo-omgil-su-issoyo', 5, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '우리 약속을 토요일로 옮길 수 있어요?', '{"English":"Can we move our appointment to Saturday?","German":"Können wir unsere Verabredung auf Samstag verschieben?"}', '17157509a37d0b6b55b385e42061b7e72d2c60ad0535cec88d433049eac5f3c2'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 6, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '일이 있어서 오늘은 못 가요. 죄송해요.', '{"English":"I have work, so I cannot go today. I am sorry.","German":"Ich habe Arbeit, deshalb kann ich heute nicht gehen. Es tut mir leid."}', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-037-jega-jeonyeok-salgeyo', 7, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '좋아요. 함께 먹어요. 제가 저녁을 살게요.', '{"English":"Sounds good. Let us eat together. I will pay for dinner.","German":"Gern. Essen wir zusammen. Ich übernehme das Abendessen."}', '5397a94ee29c01aac214be7943555de870fef92dcc3f6f357d699ab23e617306'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-038-jogeum-neujeul-geot-gatayo', 8, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '조금 늦을 것 같아요. 먼저 들어가세요.', '{"English":"I think I will be a little late. Please go in ahead of me.","German":"Ich werde wohl etwas zu spät sein. Geh schon mal rein."}', 'aa60449e8d79735ccef2595e9d977a6a07e7a2cd79a561bcaa6719803a16fb63'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-039-geureom-toyoil-du-si', 9, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '그럼 토요일 두 시 맞아요?', '{"English":"Then Saturday at two is correct?","German":"Dann ist Samstag um zwei richtig?"}', '777e83489cc94454752328460c17fd1299bf24b5885551a4245b38be5ffcd628'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-040-jumare-hangang-gal-geoyeyo', 10, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '주말에 한강 공원에 갈 거예요.', '{"English":"At the weekend I will go to Hangang Park.","German":"Am Wochenende werde ich in den Hangang-Park gehen."}', 'e30c2b54c69cd099548be9e3e06a8ede08b372bcafeaa2a9061cdca8dccdb591'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-5', 'korean-a2-practical-5-041-cha-jumunhaesseoyo', 1, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '저는 커피 말고 차를 주문했어요.', '{"English":"I ordered tea, not coffee.","German":"Ich habe Tee bestellt, keinen Kaffee."}', 'fcce211b019fe7b1ac30039e999db0bc14dd9390d9391a468bed1cb0dc65cc52'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-5', 'korean-a2-practical-5-042-jageun-sai-je-gyohwan', 2, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '좀 작아요. 교환할 수 있어요?', '{"English":"It is a little small. Can I exchange it?","German":"Es ist etwas klein. Kann ich es umtauschen?"}', 'c2655bca27bf88382ad733fd7e3848ff0aebf9ba093bc28d85d1921d28e1e372'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-5', 'korean-a2-practical-5-043-tansansu-malgo-mul', 3, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '탄산수 말고 그냥 물 주세요.', '{"English":"Plain water instead of sparkling water, please.","German":"Bitte normales Wasser statt Sprudelwasser."}', '9b8563467e6abcbb787e51b3f49e11bd803df3e7bca00f3f973f09f6ce5a22a1'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-5', 'korean-a2-practical-5-044-igeo-malgo-jeogeo', 4, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '이거 말고 저거 하나 주세요.', '{"English":"That one over there, not this one, please.","German":"Bitte das da, nicht dieses hier."}', 'e474481c9973746db5ffaf979720c820a7211dbd5d4f7119187f22dfe5fa41cc'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-5', 'korean-a2-practical-5-045-bang-sikkeureowoyo', 5, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '방이 너무 시끄러워요. 다른 방 있어요?', '{"English":"The room is too noisy. Is there another room?","German":"Das Zimmer ist zu laut. Gibt es ein anderes Zimmer?"}', '2660410213d4840c0c9f1151f95f3dc79c47fd0e9923cc3988c7c76ce856588e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-5', 'korean-a2-practical-5-046-aniyo-igeo-hanaman', 6, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '아니요, 괜찮아요. 이거 하나만 주세요.', '{"English":"No, thank you. Just this one, please.","German":"Nein, danke. Bitte nur dieses eine."}', 'd0ebf6e21d86d259f9bb599c6c732cf456ddbd1e26f1145dac789ce4cc7f08d6'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-5', 'korean-a2-practical-5-047-gyesan-an-majayo', 7, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '계산이 안 맞아요. 다시 봐 주세요.', '{"English":"The calculation is not right. Please check again.","German":"Die Rechnung stimmt nicht. Bitte schauen Sie noch einmal nach."}', '28d4dddcbcd026e417dc5270af08cb7746452b9122bc7da75e845a42bd673637'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-5', 'korean-a2-practical-5-048-deo-jageun-geollo', 8, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '이것보다 더 작은 걸로 주세요.', '{"English":"Please give me a smaller one than this.","German":"Bitte eine kleinere als diese hier."}', '1a8380e14adbba5bf281c5e37ab89180c9e3a1ad3daf55ffee1821c11865cd89'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-5', 'korean-a2-practical-5-049-sinae-malgo-seoul-yeogeuro', 9, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '시내 말고 서울역으로 가 주세요.', '{"English":"To Seoul Station, not downtown, please.","German":"Bitte zum Bahnhof Seoul, nicht in die Innenstadt."}', '077023e9472e55d0209dcf5e0f058dfd986d9494eaa2e1f6ba7602489d11937c'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-5', 'korean-a2-practical-5-050-oneureun-eoryeowoyo', 10, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '오늘은 좀 어려워요. 다음에 가요.', '{"English":"Today is a little difficult. Let us go another time.","German":"Heute ist es etwas schwierig. Gehen wir ein anderes Mal."}', '3e6dc2679d0d3a1a84068bdf6f0377db1078c427a37bd40582ee8419f2b38fde'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-6', 'korean-a2-practical-6-051-setak-eonje-dwaeyo', 1, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '세탁 좀 부탁해요. 언제 돼요?', '{"English":"Please do the laundry. When will it be ready?","German":"Bitte waschen Sie das. Wann ist es fertig?"}', '8c1f8b8d14111e4e5a9d7605d3327ea53ad3834198a75ce064b271d850324da0'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-6', 'korean-a2-practical-6-052-hwamyeon-suri-hal-su-issoyo', 2, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '화면이 고장 났어요. 수리할 수 있어요?', '{"English":"The screen broke. Can you repair it?","German":"Der Bildschirm ist kaputtgegangen. Können Sie ihn reparieren?"}', '7a7c8d8ffc78bde44e5f3a11a664e2c7b97215710400ba817b13d56c9666d2f0'),
