  ('korean-a2-practical-7', 'korean-a2-practical-7-070-chucheoni-choegoyeyo', 10, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '정말 맛있어요. 이 집이 최고예요.', '{"English":"It is really delicious. This place is the best.","German":"Es ist wirklich lecker. Dieses Lokal ist das Beste."}', '65c696581978aaafa87a4269128f79bffe4f540bd9ff31ef11d90f4f06941c3f'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-8', 'korean-a2-practical-8-071-jinjjayo-gippeoyo', 1, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '진짜요? 와, 잘됐네요! 저도 기뻐요.', '{"English":"Really? Wow, that is great! I am happy too.","German":"Wirklich? Wow, das ist toll! Ich freue mich auch."}', 'fb0f8e6927d2548c786f69d98d58617f48a31026bab604a7cc45aee4b8f07788'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-8', 'korean-a2-practical-8-072-yeoreum-gataeyo', 2, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '오늘 진짜 더워요. 여름 같아요.', '{"English":"It is really hot today. It feels like summer.","German":"Heute ist es wirklich heiß. Es ist wie Sommer."}', 'cb0fc519e302ce9fee2f439b4ee7f15e3c3a67d95f9d7c3e2a6f346130446604'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-8', 'korean-a2-practical-8-073-neutge-jasseoyo', 3, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '좀 피곤해요. 어제 늦게 잤어요.', '{"English":"I am a little tired. I went to bed late yesterday.","German":"Ich bin etwas müde. Gestern bin ich spät ins Bett gegangen."}', 'cb525de4c60c374803880dc7532eda9068de29a246c8b1e3b8626aa11ab0dc16'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-8', 'korean-a2-practical-8-074-ibeon-jue-bappayo', 4, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '이번 주에 저는 정말 바빠요.', '{"English":"I am really busy this week.","German":"Diese Woche bin ich wirklich beschäftigt."}', '951775130cc9038377ebda195cd32e080749a560fd40d06fba9a4176fb55c201'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-8', 'korean-a2-practical-8-075-usan-eopsseoyo', 5, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '또 비가 와요. 우산이 없어요.', '{"English":"It is raining again. I do not have an umbrella.","German":"Es regnet schon wieder. Ich habe keinen Regenschirm."}', '0e53ce246cee3b9efbb969ced11c1c1e23a346e9ebf1e8d0825b84c405cb24e5'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-8', 'korean-a2-practical-8-076-aigo-andoennaeyo', 6, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '아이고, 안됐네요. 저도 정말 아쉬워요.', '{"English":"Oh, that is too bad. I find it really disappointing too.","German":"Ach, das ist schade. Ich finde es auch wirklich enttäuschend."}', '47b740861ce8251e5d245bb4e99f168445b62a1d198742c9d9af4ce16f605bed'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-8', 'korean-a2-practical-8-077-yojeum-jal-jinaeyo', 7, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '네, 요즘 아주 잘 지내요.', '{"English":"Yes, I am doing very well these days.","German":"Ja, mir geht es in letzter Zeit sehr gut."}', '1b2209e71af8d24487827615a7a15d11fb497fb2740130dbbd5f82768380765a'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-8', 'korean-a2-practical-8-078-wa-jaldoenneyo', 8, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '와, 잘됐네요! 정말 좋은 소식이에요.', '{"English":"Wow, that is great! That is really good news.","German":"Wow, das ist toll! Das sind wirklich gute Nachrichten."}', 'a9194befc8ccd004a76337ff46331a3b40156a264482a4f7f3cc0a6a38e05db9'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-8', 'korean-a2-practical-8-079-achim-e-chuwoyo', 9, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '아침에 너무 추워요. 따뜻한 커피가 필요해요.', '{"English":"It is so cold in the morning. I need a warm coffee.","German":"Morgens ist es so kalt. Ich brauche einen warmen Kaffee."}', '9d8323eb398be9056405537688dda409246b6f7e3e8921b6068a5b2321ffe383'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-8', 'korean-a2-practical-8-080-joheun-haruyeoyo', 10, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '오늘 정말 좋은 하루예요. 그렇죠?', '{"English":"Today is really a good day. Right?","German":"Heute ist wirklich ein guter Tag. Oder?"}', '8ba047939c8b2862b3fb6f11ce49a1af7fa59d95c726367c69de8b04cf9424fe'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-081-syawogi-gojang-nasseoyo', 1, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '샤워기가 고장 났어요. 지금 안 돼요. 도와주세요.', '{"English":"The shower broke. It does not work now. Please help me.","German":"Die Dusche ist kaputtgegangen. Jetzt funktioniert sie nicht. Bitte helfen Sie mir."}', '18125a9d66fad87128d0fb89494b4b9abf29ea0dcd258c554b714d5e6437b051'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-082-samsip-bun-jumun', 2, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '삼십 분 전에 주문했어요. 음식이 아직 안 와요. 확인해 주세요.', '{"English":"I ordered thirty minutes ago. The food has not come yet. Please check it.","German":"Ich habe vor dreißig Minuten bestellt. Das Essen kommt noch nicht. Bitte prüfen Sie das."}', '7d008ec944dc478aae04db0bf43c7d92322d43d15e941bbd83a89d456707e507'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-083-waipai-an-dwaeyo', 3, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '어제 호텔에 왔어요. 방에서 와이파이가 안 돼요. 도와주세요.', '{"English":"I arrived at the hotel yesterday. The Wi-Fi does not work in the room. Please help me.","German":"Gestern bin ich im Hotel angekommen. Im Zimmer funktioniert das WLAN nicht. Bitte helfen Sie mir."}', '93871a060293c9db50be284fdad8837567219f475069a753ec76d4a94586c737'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-084-jigabeul-ireobeoryeosseoyo', 4, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '지갑을 잃어버렸어요. 같이 찾아 주세요.', '{"English":"I lost my wallet. Please help me look for it.","German":"Ich habe meine Geldbörse verloren. Bitte suchen Sie mit mir."}', 'a3aa12386b67cce355037fe96415aa0f8e17a838daa6bf3162b67aa498fb8e03'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 5, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '택시 회사에 전화했어요. 아직 안 와요. 다른 택시 불러 주세요.', '{"English":"I called the taxi company. It has not come yet. Please call another taxi.","German":"Ich habe beim Taxiunternehmen angerufen. Es ist noch nicht da. Bitte rufen Sie ein anderes Taxi."}', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 6, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '계산했어요. 그런데 거스름돈이 천 원 모자라요. 확인해 주세요.', '{"English":"I paid. But the change is short a thousand won. Please check it.","German":"Ich habe bezahlt. Aber beim Wechselgeld fehlen tausend Won. Bitte prüfen Sie das."}', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 7, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '오늘 샀어요. 그런데 벌써 안 돼요. 바꿔 주세요.', '{"English":"I bought it today. But it already does not work. Please exchange it.","German":"Ich habe es heute gekauft. Aber es funktioniert schon nicht. Bitte tauschen Sie es um."}', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 8, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '국을 주문했어요. 지금 좀 차가워요. 따뜻하게 해 줄 수 있어요?', '{"English":"I ordered soup. It is a little cold now. Can you warm it up?","German":"Ich habe Suppe bestellt. Sie ist jetzt etwas kalt. Können Sie sie warm machen?"}', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 9, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '옆방이 너무 시끄러워요. 잘 못 잤어요. 방을 바꿔 주세요.', '{"English":"The next room is too loud. I did not sleep well. Please change my room.","German":"Das Zimmer nebenan ist zu laut. Ich habe nicht gut geschlafen. Bitte wechseln Sie mein Zimmer."}', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-090-ije-da-gwaenchanayo', 10, 'bright', 'Korean', 'ko-KR', 'German', '어제 전화했어요. 이제 다 괜찮아요. 정말 감사합니다.', '{"English":"I called yesterday. Everything is okay now. Thank you very much.","German":"Gestern habe ich angerufen. Jetzt ist alles in Ordnung. Vielen Dank."}', '16cf26408b6c7865667a5ef1e626b4a82cdb95abdc107353132973e0da346a42'),
  ('polish-a1-practical-1', 'polish-a1-practical-1-lesson-1-first-contact', 1, 'bright', 'Polish', 'pl-PL', 'German', 'Dzień dobry, czy mówi się tu po angielsku?', '{"English":"Hello, do you speak English?","German":"Guten Tag, sprechen Sie Englisch?"}', '58319075324fd0ae2232c8e60a2414aae3200190c40a736f24036b217d14ebdb'),
  ('polish-a1-practical-1', 'polish-a1-practical-1-lesson-2-repeat-slowly', 2, 'bright', 'Polish', 'pl-PL', 'German', 'Przepraszam, nie rozumiem. Proszę powtórzyć powoli.', '{"English":"Sorry, I don’t understand. Please repeat slowly.","German":"Entschuldigung, ich verstehe nicht. Bitte langsam wiederholen."}', '2487ae1b535f5c68fb9376a3e8a1e85e4250cb316bb75e60c665517ae9235708'),
  ('polish-a1-practical-1', 'polish-a1-practical-1-lesson-3-where-is-station', 3, 'bright', 'Polish', 'pl-PL', 'German', 'Przepraszam, gdzie jest dworzec?', '{"English":"Excuse me, where is the train station?","German":"Entschuldigung, wo ist der Bahnhof?"}', '868dbd371a8388ea14a3664a3ff7090d6d4d36d1e8cadd94124001f7a549e351'),
  ('polish-a1-practical-1', 'polish-a1-practical-1-lesson-4-coffee-please', 4, 'bright', 'Polish', 'pl-PL', 'German', 'Poproszę kawę.', '{"English":"A coffee, please.","German":"Einen Kaffee, bitte."}', '2db627e62d391e7d0e2c33c6ff6a3b21e4ea7880edf1f2d44d79e4ee636523c4'),
  ('polish-a1-practical-1', 'polish-a1-practical-1-lesson-5-how-much', 5, 'bright', 'Polish', 'pl-PL', 'German', 'Ile to kosztuje?', '{"English":"How much is that?","German":"Wie viel kostet das?"}', '6d2b93ffc386525a64dcc5787668b4760e985ce85167bac6d680acc7be8d5bc3'),
  ('polish-a1-practical-1', 'polish-a1-practical-1-lesson-6-train-time', 6, 'bright', 'Polish', 'pl-PL', 'German', 'Przepraszam, o której odjeżdża pociąg?', '{"English":"Excuse me, when does the train leave?","German":"Entschuldigung, wann fährt der Zug?"}', '1b5763d51342e44e64e3929ca48a30ec1832f645ba9bc9ed0f032ec1083ca991'),
  ('polish-a1-practical-1', 'polish-a1-practical-1-lesson-7-need-help', 7, 'bright', 'Polish', 'pl-PL', 'German', 'Przepraszam, potrzebuję pomocy.', '{"English":"Excuse me, I need help.","German":"Entschuldigung, ich brauche Hilfe."}', 'a6ec8badd06df9374768eab57b3d4823d8bb574086d835b556fcee17b5b9574f'),
